# AttendPro 📱

AttendPro is a modern Android attendance management application designed to make student attendance tracking simple, fast, and organized.

## ✨ Features

- 📊 Attendance tracking
- 📚 Subject management
- 📅 Attendance history
- 📈 Attendance statistics
- 🎨 Modern and user-friendly UI
- 💾 Local data management
- ⚡ Fast and easy to use

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Java
- Android Studio
- XML
- SQLite
- Gradle

## 🎯 Purpose

AttendPro is designed to help students easily record and monitor their attendance and keep track of their academic attendance requirements.

